{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01076",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.37,
      "end_seconds": 5.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Hi doctor, um, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.84,
      "end_seconds": 10.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.84,
      "end_seconds": 24.37,
      "duration_seconds": 12.53,
      "text": "Sorry, uh, what was I saying, it's vomiting blood. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.03,
      "end_seconds": 27.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.36,
      "end_seconds": 44.57,
      "duration_seconds": 16.21,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream. I take it when needed for the eczema. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back. I take ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, three times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.11,
      "end_seconds": 49.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "How often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.96,
      "end_seconds": 67.53,
      "duration_seconds": 17.57,
      "text": "I'd say a few times a day. I've been feeling faint too, since yesterday. As for feeling faint, a four out of ten, I suppose. It's every other day. Yes, standing. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.74,
      "end_seconds": 71.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "I follow. Did you get fever or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.29,
      "end_seconds": 76.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.52,
      "end_seconds": 82.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Alright, any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.48,
      "end_seconds": 86.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.71,
      "end_seconds": 90.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.14,
      "end_seconds": 96.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.33,
      "end_seconds": 105.86,
      "duration_seconds": 8.53,
      "text": "Alright, are there any allergies I should be aware of? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.72,
      "end_seconds": 110.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.26,
      "end_seconds": 116.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Right, any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.55,
      "end_seconds": 119.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Yes, eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.75,
      "end_seconds": 131.96,
      "duration_seconds": 11.21,
      "text": "Right, so eczema is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.14,
      "end_seconds": 146.39,
      "duration_seconds": 13.25,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago. My partner and our baby. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.08,
      "end_seconds": 149.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.37,
      "end_seconds": 155.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Just an operation for a hernia, last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.55,
      "end_seconds": 168.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.32,
      "end_seconds": 184.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.19,
      "end_seconds": 211.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "Okay: temp 37.1 degrees, pulse 118. And BP is 124 over 71, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.95,
      "end_seconds": 213.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.8,
      "end_seconds": 217.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "We'll look at it together shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.2,
      "end_seconds": 222.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.05,
      "end_seconds": 225.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.35,
      "end_seconds": 227.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.51,
      "end_seconds": 242.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.35,
      "text": "You look pale, your pulse is fast and your tummy is tender at the top."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.81,
      "end_seconds": 249.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.32,
      "end_seconds": 280.29,
      "duration_seconds": 11.97,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, this is probably a possible bleeding stomach ulcer. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.98,
      "end_seconds": 282.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.13,
      "end_seconds": 293.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.55,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a possible bleeding stomach ulcer is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.78,
      "end_seconds": 309.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "I'm sending you for an endoscopy because of bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 310.52,
      "end_seconds": 315.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "We have a slot Monday at 9 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.02,
      "end_seconds": 330.49,
      "duration_seconds": 13.47,
      "text": "I want urgent blood tests done, that's for bleeding. Please stop the ibuprofen and do not eat or drink. The emergency team would be the right next step, I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.88,
      "end_seconds": 332.58,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.46,
      "end_seconds": 340.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.25,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if you vomit again, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.85,
      "end_seconds": 343.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.25,
      "end_seconds": 352.07,
      "duration_seconds": 7.82,
      "text": "Come back straight away. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.99,
      "end_seconds": 357.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "So, I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.3,
      "end_seconds": 364.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.12,
      "end_seconds": 368.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.45,
      "end_seconds": 370.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}